Ok...I finally fixed it.  I talked to Compaq, and they were a bit less =
than helpful, but then I came back and read Guy Draper's email.  He =
simply suggested running the lan_config commands manually.  Well I did, =
and that answered all my questions.  It said "function not implemented". =
 Then I thought about it--it's configured with NetRAIN, so the ee =
devices wouldn't need changing...it would be the nr0 device.  So I did a =
lan_config -i nr0 -s 100 -x 1   and checked how it was running...and =
both ee cards were in Full Duplex 100!!!   I was so happy.  anyway, I =
hope this fixes my network problems.  =3D)  Thanks for all the replies =
everybody. =20

