Thanks to all.  

It's easy.  take a windows laptop, a serial cable, and com1 on an es40
and hook them up.  then run hyperterminal and direct it to the PC's
COM1, start text capture.  Bring down the ES40 to >>> and set the
console to 'serial'.  Boot from the PC Terminal session.  Every last
detail goes into Hyperterminal's Capture.txt file.

