Finally i solved my problem.

to change ALPHASTATION/ALPHASERVER setting must do:

examine IIC_RCM_NVRAM0:11

if result is 01 your system is an Alphastation, if result is 00 your 
system is an Alphaserver.

To set system type do:

deposit IIC_RCM_NVRAM0:11 <value>
00 for alphaserver
01 for alphastation

That's all!

Many thanks to:
Compaq Engineers from Colorado Springs
Compaq Customer Service 
All to suggested me something!

Marco.

