To change the value run:

# ifconfig tu0 ipmtu 1024
or to make it "permanent" across reboots modify your /etc/rc.config file and
add the ipmtu option.
FCONFIG_0="xxx.yyy.zzz.aaa netmask 255.255.0.0 ipmtu 1024"

