I get the following error message:

  Error: Spool command -- lpr  -Plp3 /tmp/_pp_0000022539_265
  Action: Resolve error and then resubmit print job
          Press "C" to cancel print job

  I have checked the /etc/printcap file and the printers are setup =
properly. =20

