I had asked about 2 9GB disks in the spareset on an esa1000
scsi array with HSZ70s at firmware rev 7.3, where disks 
show size when not in spareset, but once in spareset size
appears to be "NOT YET KNOWN". This behavior was also observed
when disks were put in a mirror.

Responses pointed out:
	- this is normal, until we "ADD UNIT" of mirrorset
	  no size may be visible.
	- size may be visible once storageset is initialized

