From tru64-unix-managers  Tue Aug 07 13:45:22 2001
From: "Rost, Werner" <Werner.Rost () boge ! mannesmann ! de>
Date: Tue, 07 Aug 2001 13:45:22 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: SUMMARY: lpd: debug output in lpr.log
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=102653669621788

Thanks to

James Sainsbury [sainsb_j@chem.usyd.edu.au]
Jim Smart [jim@tsw.com.au]
O'Brien, Pat [pobrien@mitidata.com]
Bill.Melvin@esc.edu

for their quick answers.

All of them pointed me to the file /etc/syslog.conf. Here I should comment
out the line "lpr.debug ..." or change "debug" to "info". After commenting
out this line I stopped and started syslogd:

   /sbin/init.d/syslog stop
   /sbin/init.d/syslog start

Now the messages do not appear anymore.

regards

Werner Rost, KIR
Mannesmann Boge GmbH

