Hi Again Managers:
I just wanted to thank you for the responses I received for the below issue
on 8/1 and am happy to say that I discovered that the graphics card was the
cause of the problem, so I removed it and was able to load the new firmware
and the Unix 5.1 operating system. Thanks in particular to Jim Lola, Dan
Price, and all others that responded. Its nice to have such a great resource
to fall back on if needed. Once again everyone, Thanks.

------------------------------------------------------
Mark Centifonti
Systems Administrator
NJ. Dept. of Agriculture
------------------------------------------------------






Hello Managers:
Something tells me the answer to this question is a resounding NO, but here
goes....

